# @geastack-community/query Specific Rules

This package provides data-fetching and caching utilities for Gea.

## Implementation Patterns

When injecting query capabilities into a Gea component, use the `withQuery` mixin.

```typescript
import { BaseComponent } from '@geajs/core';
import { withQuery } from '@geastack-community/query';

class MyComponent extends withQuery(BaseComponent) {
  constructor() {
    super();
    this.registerQuery('userData', {
      queryFn: async () => {
        const res = await fetch('/api/user');
        return res.json();
      },
      staleTime: 1000 * 60 * 5,
    });
  }

  render() {
    const { data, isLoading, error } = this.getQueryState('userData');
    if (isLoading) return 'Loading...';
    if (error) return `Error: ${error.message}`;
    return `Hello, ${data.name}!`;
  }

  override dispose() {
    super.dispose();
  }
}
```